{"content_hash": "7a4669d6beb8d9f7", "version_id": 1034, "article_id": 104, "level_code": "en_b2", "lang": "en", "level": 4, "level_label": "B2 中高级", "title": "Apple's 2026 report card: users get to grade the tech giant", "title_zh": "苹果2026成绩单出炉，这次由用户来打分", "has_translation": true, "topic": "lifestyle", "source": "sspai", "source_url": "https://sspai.com/post/119191", "image": {"type": "photo", "url": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1621768216002-5ac171876625?ixid=M3wxMDk3Mzk1fDB8MXxzZWFyY2h8N3x8YXBwbGV8ZW58MHwwfHx8MTc5NTIyODc3OHww&ixlib=rb-4.1.0&w=1600&q=75&fm=jpg&fit=max", "provider": "unsplash", "credit": "Photo by Sumudu Mohottige on Unsplash", "author": "Sumudu Mohottige", "credit_url": "https://unsplash.com/@stm_2790?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "source": "Unsplash", "source_url": "https://unsplash.com/photos/apple-logo-on-metallic-surface-bIgpii04UIg?utm_source=daily-english-news&utm_medium=referral", "fallback": {"type": "gradient", "from": "hsl(235, 42%, 62%)", "to": "hsl(273, 46%, 48%)", "label": "LIFESTYLE", "seed": "787389163722"}}, "published_date": "2026-11-21", "word_count": 278, "reading_minutes": 1.4, "lead": "Apple packed 2026 with new hardware, a new CEO and a long-awaited AI assistant. Now one Chinese tech site is asking its readers to rate how well the company did.", "lead_zh": "苹果在2026年推出了不少新硬件，换了新CEO，还带来了大家期待已久的AI助手。现在，一家中国科技网站邀请读者来评价苹果这一年的表现。", "preview": "Apple expanded its hardware lineup quickly in 2026. The affordable MacBook Neo, built around an A-series chip, brought the Mac to more buyer", "preview_zh": "苹果在2026年迅速扩充了硬件产品线。搭载A系列芯片、价格亲民的MacBook Neo让更多消费者买得起Mac，不过也有人质疑它在性能上做了妥协。M6芯片进一步提升了Apple Silicon的能效，新款MacBook Pro则首次加入OLED触控屏。与此同时，iPhone 18", "has_audio": true, "audio": {"id": 1017, "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/104/en_b2.mp3", "duration": 110.9, "size_bytes": 666288, "engine": "kokoro", "voice": "af_heart", "word_count": 313, "has_timeline": true, "alternates": [{"voice": "af_bella", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/104/en_b2_af_bella.mp3", "duration": 113.0, "size_bytes": 678960, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 313, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/104/en_b2_af_bella.json"}, {"voice": "am_michael", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/104/en_b2_am_michael.mp3", "duration": 120.2, "size_bytes": 722160, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 313, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/104/en_b2_am_michael.json"}, {"voice": "bf_emma", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/104/en_b2_bf_emma.mp3", "duration": 104.125, "size_bytes": 625680, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 313, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/104/en_b2_bf_emma.json"}, {"voice": "bm_george", "url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/audio/104/en_b2_bm_george.mp3", "duration": 114.25, "size_bytes": 686448, "engine": "kokoro", "word_count": 313, "has_timeline": true, "timeline_url": "https://pub-aba43a6fb1db4dc08fede1dbc81f3241.r2.dev/timeline/104/en_b2_bm_george.json"}]}, "detail_url": "https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/chjam12301-sys/news-etl@37390ad4/content/data/versions/1034.json", "paragraphs": ["Apple expanded its hardware lineup quickly in 2026. The affordable MacBook Neo, built around an A-series chip, brought the Mac to more buyers, though some questioned whether it sacrificed performance. The M6 chip pushed Apple Silicon's energy efficiency further, and the new MacBook Pro added an OLED touchscreen for the first time. Meanwhile, the iPhone 18 Pro gained a variable aperture, and the foldable iPhone Duo drew the most attention despite its high price, weight and limited app support.", "The year also marked a turning point in how Apple is run. After 15 years, Tim Cook handed the company to John Ternus, opening a new leadership era. A smarter Siri, able to understand personal context and work across apps, finally entered testing with iOS 27, but its maturity is still unproven and its launch in China keeps lagging behind the rest of the world. The controversial Liquid Glass design was refined after user feedback.", "Regulators have begun to slow the growth of App Store revenue, even as services income stays strong. With hardware margins under pressure and commission models restricted, what will drive Apple's next stage of growth remains a central question for the market. From 2021, the site Shaoshupai has run its Apple annual rating five times, and the project has become a fixture readers look forward to.", "This year the site is inviting a wider audience to take part. Until January 3, 2027, registered users with accounts at least 30 days old can fill in a questionnaire rating Apple's 2026 performance across nine areas. Scores appear in real time, results will be published early next year, and 15 users who leave thoughtful comments will receive gifts."], "paragraphs_zh": ["苹果在2026年迅速扩充了硬件产品线。搭载A系列芯片、价格亲民的MacBook Neo让更多消费者买得起Mac，不过也有人质疑它在性能上做了妥协。M6芯片进一步提升了Apple Silicon的能效，新款MacBook Pro则首次加入OLED触控屏。与此同时，iPhone 18 Pro增加了可变光圈，折叠屏手机iPhone Duo虽然售价高、机身重、应用适配有限，却依然最受关注。", "这一年也成为苹果经营方式的转折点。执掌公司15年后，Tim Cook把接力棒交给John Ternus，开启新的领导时代。能够理解个人情境、跨应用操作的更聪明Siri终于随iOS 27进入测试，但成熟度仍待检验，在中国的上线进度也继续落后于全球。备受争议的“液态玻璃”设计在听取用户反馈后得到打磨。", "监管机构已开始拖慢App Store收入的增长，尽管服务收入依然强劲。在硬件毛利承压、抽成模式受限的情况下，苹果下一阶段靠什么增长，仍是市场关注的核心问题。从2021年起，少数派已连续五次举办“Apple年度评分”活动，这个策划已成为读者期待的固定项目。", "今年，少数派邀请更广泛的用户参与。到2027年1月3日为止，注册满30天的用户可填写问卷，从九个方面评价苹果2026年的表现。评分会实时显示，结果将于明年初公布，另有15名留下有见地评语的用户将获得礼品。"], "body": "Apple expanded its hardware lineup quickly in 2026. The affordable MacBook Neo, built around an A-series chip, brought the Mac to more buyers, though some questioned whether it sacrificed performance. The M6 chip pushed Apple Silicon's energy efficiency further, and the new MacBook Pro added an OLED touchscreen for the first time. Meanwhile, the iPhone 18 Pro gained a variable aperture, and the foldable iPhone Duo drew the most attention despite its high price, weight and limited app support.\n\nThe year also marked a turning point in how Apple is run. After 15 years, Tim Cook handed the company to John Ternus, opening a new leadership era. A smarter Siri, able to understand personal context and work across apps, finally entered testing with iOS 27, but its maturity is still unproven and its launch in China keeps lagging behind the rest of the world. The controversial Liquid Glass design was refined after user feedback.\n\nRegulators have begun to slow the growth of App Store revenue, even as services income stays strong. With hardware margins under pressure and commission models restricted, what will drive Apple's next stage of growth remains a central question for the market. From 2021, the site Shaoshupai has run its Apple annual rating five times, and the project has become a fixture readers look forward to.\n\nThis year the site is inviting a wider audience to take part. Until January 3, 2027, registered users with accounts at least 30 days old can fill in a questionnaire rating Apple's 2026 performance across nine areas. Scores appear in real time, results will be published early next year, and 15 users who leave thoughtful comments will receive gifts.", "body_zh": "苹果在2026年迅速扩充了硬件产品线。搭载A系列芯片、价格亲民的MacBook Neo让更多消费者买得起Mac，不过也有人质疑它在性能上做了妥协。M6芯片进一步提升了Apple Silicon的能效，新款MacBook Pro则首次加入OLED触控屏。与此同时，iPhone 18 Pro增加了可变光圈，折叠屏手机iPhone Duo虽然售价高、机身重、应用适配有限，却依然最受关注。\n\n这一年也成为苹果经营方式的转折点。执掌公司15年后，Tim Cook把接力棒交给John Ternus，开启新的领导时代。能够理解个人情境、跨应用操作的更聪明Siri终于随iOS 27进入测试，但成熟度仍待检验，在中国的上线进度也继续落后于全球。备受争议的“液态玻璃”设计在听取用户反馈后得到打磨。\n\n监管机构已开始拖慢App Store收入的增长，尽管服务收入依然强劲。在硬件毛利承压、抽成模式受限的情况下，苹果下一阶段靠什么增长，仍是市场关注的核心问题。从2021年起，少数派已连续五次举办“Apple年度评分”活动，这个策划已成为读者期待的固定项目。\n\n今年，少数派邀请更广泛的用户参与。到2027年1月3日为止，注册满30天的用户可填写问卷，从九个方面评价苹果2026年的表现。评分会实时显示，结果将于明年初公布，另有15名留下有见地评语的用户将获得礼品。", "text": "Apple expanded its hardware lineup quickly in 2026. The affordable MacBook Neo, built around an A-series chip, brought the Mac to more buyers, though some questioned whether it sacrificed performance. The M6 chip pushed Apple Silicon's energy efficiency further, and the new MacBook Pro added an OLED touchscreen for the first time. Meanwhile, the iPhone 18 Pro gained a variable aperture, and the foldable iPhone Duo drew the most attention despite its high price, weight and limited app support. The year also marked a turning point in how Apple is run. After 15 years, Tim Cook handed the company to John Ternus, opening a new leadership era. A smarter Siri, able to understand personal context and work across apps, finally entered testing with iOS 27, but its maturity is still unproven and its launch in China keeps lagging behind the rest of the world. The controversial Liquid Glass design was refined after user feedback. Regulators have begun to slow the growth of App Store revenue, even as services income stays strong. With hardware margins under pressure and commission models restricted, what will drive Apple's next stage of growth remains a central question for the market. From 2021, the site Shaoshupai has run its Apple annual rating five times, and the project has become a fixture readers look forward to. This year the site is inviting a wider audience to take part. Until January 3, 2027, registered users with accounts at least 30 days old can fill in a questionnaire rating Apple's 2026 performance across nine areas. Scores appear in real time, results will be published early next year, and 15 users who leave thoughtful comments will receive gifts.", "vocab": [{"word": "lineup", "pos": "noun", "zh": "产品线", "note": "常指品牌旗下的全部产品", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "affordable", "pos": "adj", "zh": "价格亲民的", "note": "强调买得起，比cheap更中性", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "sacrifice", "pos": "verb", "zh": "牺牲、放弃", "note": "常与performance、quality搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "energy efficiency", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "能效", "note": "科技报道高频搭配", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "variable aperture", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "可变光圈", "note": "手机摄影术语", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "foldable", "pos": "adj", "zh": "可折叠的", "note": "foldable phone 折叠屏手机", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "turning point", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "转折点", "note": "表示局势发生关键变化", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "hand over", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "移交、交接", "note": "hand sth to sb 把某物交给某人", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "unproven", "pos": "adj", "zh": "未经检验的", "note": "反义为proven", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "lag behind", "pos": "phrase", "zh": "落后于", "note": "常接市场、对手等", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "margin", "pos": "noun", "zh": "利润率、毛利", "note": "under pressure 表示承压", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}, {"word": "questionnaire", "pos": "noun", "zh": "问卷", "note": "fill in a questionnaire 填写问卷", "phonetic": "", "en": ""}], "fetched_at": "2026-11-21T02:39:37.216062", "timeline": [{"i": 0, "w": "Apple", "s": 0.3, "e": 0.6, "sm": 300, "em": 600, "cs": 0, "ce": 5, "si": 0}, {"i": 1, "w": "expanded", "s": 0.6, "e": 1.188, "sm": 600, "em": 1187, "cs": 6, "ce": 14, "si": 0}, {"i": 2, "w": "its", "s": 1.188, "e": 1.35, "sm": 1187, "em": 1350, "cs": 15, "ce": 18, "si": 0}, {"i": 3, "w": "hardware", "s": 1.35, "e": 1.775, "sm": 1350, "em": 1774, "cs": 19, "ce": 27, "si": 0}, {"i": 4, "w": "lineup", "s": 1.775, "e": 2.163, "sm": 1775, "em": 2162, "cs": 28, "ce": 34, "si": 0}, {"i": 5, "w": "quickly", "s": 2.163, "e": 2.663, "sm": 2162, "em": 2662, "cs": 35, "ce": 42, "si": 0}, {"i": 6, "w": "in", "s": 2.663, "e": 2.825, "sm": 2662, "em": 2825, "cs": 43, "ce": 45, "si": 0}, {"i": 7, "w": "2026", "s": 2.825, "e": 4.25, "sm": 2825, "em": 4249, "cs": 46, "ce": 50, "si": 0}, {"i": 8, "w": ".", "s": 4.25, "e": 4.388, "sm": 4250, "em": 4387, "cs": 50, "ce": 51, "si": 0}, {"i": 9, "w": "The", "s": 4.388, "e": 4.55, "sm": 4387, "em": 4549, "c